{"emailHash":"e9a4c02be488c9d1cb2728db0ad380f988f186889f63b764ea32216ba1bb65e0","parentHash":null,"from":"Bruno Akira","to":"Alicia Alinia; Holly Hampton; Federica Lombardi","subject":"NOX Emissions Confidentiality Ring Orders (CRO) - undertakings for signature","date":"2025-10-17T14:08:54.000Z","attachments":true,"body":"






Hello all,
&nbsp;
Warm welcome to NOx! As someone who will need to access confidential material, we are now adding you to the Confidentiality Rings. &nbsp;First, we will need you to sign the relevant undertaking
 from Schedule 2, Part B of each CRO (attached).
&nbsp;
I have attached to the zip folder all undertakings to be signed and the relevant sealed order. For completeness, the CROs relate to (i) Mercedes (February and July Orders) (ii) Nissan (iii)
 Renault (iv) PCD (v) Ford and (vi) Pan-Lead.
&nbsp;
We would be grateful if you could add to the undertakings the following:
&nbsp;

Your name and qualification/position (e.g., Barrister, Solicitor, etc.), to the second paragraph on page one.

Add your signature, name and date to the signature block on the second page. An&nbsp;e-signature&nbsp;is fine.
&nbsp;
The defendants have five working days to accept/refuse your addition as per paragraph 4.1.2&nbsp;of&nbsp;the sealed orders (attached). I will update once your membership has been confirmed, and
 in the meantime, please do not access confidential material. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
Please let me know if you have questions!
&nbsp;
Many thanks,
&nbsp;

​​​​Bruno&nbsp;AkiraParalegal&nbsp;(Litigation)

"}

